<title>DENMARK: SAS - Lufthansa seek half of cargo trade.</title>
<headline>SAS - Lufthansa seek half of cargo trade.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scandinavian Airlines System (SAS) expects its alliance with Germany's Lufthansa to have 50 percent of all freight traffic out of Scandinavia by the year 2000, the house magazine Inside SAS said on Monday.</p>
<p>The freight alliance, announced last February, would give both partners inceased cargo-handling capacity, it added. --Morten Pedersen, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969651</p>
